MutationRegeneration-mutated = You feel a strange tingling.
MutationRegeneration-removed = The strange tingling feeling fades.

regeneration-popup-eat = You feel a strange tingling, as if your body is trying to do something - though you feel like you could use a meal first.
regeneration-popup-sleep = You feel a strange tingling, as if your body is trying to do something - though you feel like you could use a nap first.
regeneration-popup-limb = The tingling feeling builds to a climax, until ultimately you feel a new {$part} where your old one was!
regeneration-popup-organ = The tingling feeling builds to a climax, until ultimately you feel a new {$organ} where your old one was!
regeneration-popup-visible = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))}'s {$part} reforms, making a loud, grotesque sound!